  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** × and –\n\nGiven:\n\n16 ÷ 32 × 128 + 9 – 17 = – 4\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n16 ÷ 32 - 128 + 9 × 17 = – 4\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n0.5 - 128 + 9 × 17 = – 4\n\n0.5 - 128 + 153 = – 4\n\n153.5 - 128 = – 4\n\n25.5 = - 4** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 : **÷ and +\n\n**Given:**\n\n16 ÷ 32 × 128 + 9 – 17 = – 4\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n16 + 32 × 128 ÷ 9 – 17 = – 4\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n16 + 32 × 14.23 – 17 = – 4\n\n16 + 455.36 – 17 = – 4\n\n471.36 – 17 = – 4\n\n454.36 = - 4** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3 :** × and ÷\n\n**Given:**\n\n**16 ÷ 32 × 128 + 9 – 17 = – 4**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n**16 × 32 ÷ 128 + 9 – 17 = – 4**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**16 × 0.25 + 9 – 17 = – 4**\n\n**4 + 9 – 17 = – 4**\n\n**13 – 17 = – 4**\n\n**- 4 = - 4 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 4 :** + and –\n\n**Given:**\n\n16 ÷ 32 × 128 + 9 – 17 = – 4\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n16 ÷ 32 × 128 - 9 + 17 = – 4\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n0.5 × 128 - 9 + 17 = – 4\n\n64 - 9 + 17 = – 4\n\n81 - 9 = – 4\n\n**72 = -4 ****(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****× and ÷”.**",
